Tracks Aftergraph/after-graph-governance#68.

## Gate
Do not ship positioning ahead of implementation evidence. This is a follow-up after P0 architecture/security/product slices land.

## Direction
Public positioning should move away from “another autonomous agent” and toward the infrastructure beneath persistent intelligent systems:
- portable mission/authority/delegation semantics;
- runtime enforcement;
- durable execution/recovery;
- evidence and independent verification;
- cross-runtime/model portability;
- human goal/outcome operating experience.

## Required honesty
- distinguish shipped, experimental, research and proposed surfaces;
- do not claim Meta Muse or other vendors validate Aftergraph empirical results;
- do not imply production OS isolation until Runtime/TG evidence exists;
- preserve source links/provenance for technical claims.

## Acceptance
- homepage/system launcher reflects canonical seven-plane architecture without overwhelming ordinary users;
- clear entry paths: Build, Govern, Execute, Verify, Research;
- product demos show Goal → Progress → Needs You → Verified Outcome where live evidence supports it;
- all strong claims map to exact source/evidence.

